Usage of doctor:
  -dry-run
    	report what --repair would do, without writing
  -moved-from string
    	with --repair, rewrite this owner's lock and claim stamps from this checkout's previous path (a moved or renamed worktree, loto-in0v); with --dry-run, count them
  -orphan-mode
    	scan for orphan-mode files and report them
  -repair
    	reclaim stale locks
  -restore-orphan-mode
    	with --repair, also restore writable mode on orphan-mode files (implies --orphan-mode)
